  "pull_request": {
    "number": 142,
    "title": "chore: remove stale nested Cargo.lock from workspace member",
    "body": "Closes #82\n\nRemoves `soroban_cost_lints/Cargo.lock`, a leftover from before the crate\njoined the workspace. Cargo resolves dependencies for the whole workspace\nfrom the root `Cargo.lock`, so the nested lockfile was never consulted.\n\n**Lockfile comparison:** The two lockfiles had already drifted apart.\nThe nested lockfile was missing all `cargo-cost-lint` dependencies\n(including `clap`, `heck`, `strsim`, `toml 0.8.23`, `serde_spanned 0.6.9`)\nthat are present in the root lockfile.\n\n**`.gitignore` assessment:** The nested `soroban_cost_lints/.gitignore`\n(containing only `/target`) was also checked. With the workspace build\nplacing all artifacts under the root `target/`, and no lockfile for\nstandalone builds inside the member crate, this file is now vestigial\nbut was left in place as it does no harm.\n\n**Verification:** The root `Cargo.lock` checksum is unchanged by this\nremoval; only the stale nested lockfile was deleted.",
